/// con_chatrect_x, vid_conwidth, r_glsl_postprocess_uservec1 - and DarkPlaces registers all of them
/// before any configuration file runs. Without them a read answers 0 where the engine would answer
/// its default, and cvar_set is refused ("variable not found"). <see cref="Register"/> puts them in a
/// cvar store; call it BEFORE executing default.cfg, which then overrides the ones Xonotic changes.
